    media: qcom: camss: Carry RDI geometry and height negotiation
    
    Carry the source-qualified RDI geometry proposal b45e74fd590590e274c15feb62a2229024c27d95
    into the complete Fx0 runtime assembly. Preserve the existing DMA range
    guard, MSM8226 resources and VFE completion changes. The six-file patch
    adds field validation before buffer ownership and propagates the VFE4.1
    RDI height limit through subdev and capture negotiation.
    
    Original integration80d26059f27d is by Timothy Schmidt with Claude Opus
    5.5 co-author attribution. This refresh and local qualification used
    OpenAI Codex (GPT-6). Human review and kernel DCO certification remain
    pending. This source assembly is not a full linked kernel, package or
    physical camera qualification and does not resolve the original r2 fault.

diff --git a/drivers/media/platform/qcom/camss/camss-vfe-4-1.c b/drivers/media/platform/qcom/camss/camss-vfe-4-1.c
